The '''Sinful Dice''' is an {{Epic}} crafting item. It is an {{o|e|no=y}} drop obtained from the [[Voidgloom Seraph]] {{SlayerTier|IV}}. It is used to craft the [[Sinseeker Scythe]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
'''Sinful Dice''' has a {{Green|0.47%}} ({{Green|1/217.98}}) to drop from {{Stier|4}} [[Voidgloom Seraph]] if the player has {{Coll|Enderman Slayer LVL 6}}.

